    <div class="card">
      <p>hello! welcome to my tiny pastel corner of the web. As you can probably tell, I really miss the early internet days of Geocities, MySpace, Neopets etc. I have tried to create that here, in my own small dedicated space. <img src="/assets/icons/planet.png" alt="planet"></p>
